<html>
<head>
  <script type="application/jay-data" contract="./page.jay-contract"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <div>
    <h1>Long Actions Test</h1>
    <p>DL#239 — long-running action, query, and stream. The endpoints run past
      <code>server.actionPollAfterMs</code>, so the server breaks them into a 202 + ticket poll
      (action/query) or resumable NDJSON segments (stream). The buttons drive the real client
      caller; the same endpoints are also tested directly via HTTP.</p>

    <button ref="run-action">Run Slow Action</button>
    <p>Action result: <span>{actionResult}</span></p>

    <button ref="run-query">Run Slow Query</button>
    <p>Query result: <span>{queryResult}</span></p>

    <button ref="run-stream">Run Stream</button>
    <p>Stream log: <span>{streamLog}</span></p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
